259
00:20:36.772 --> 00:20:37.973
Bekræftet.

260
00:20:38.005 --> 00:20:40.005
Brandprocedure for forreste lastrum.

261
00:20:40.038 --> 00:20:41.906
Kontakt aktiveret. 

262
00:20:41.939 --> 00:20:43.072
Bekræftet.

263
00:20:43.105 --> 00:20:44.506
Brandslukker udløst.

264
00:20:44.539 --> 00:20:45.957
Bekræftet.

265
00:20:59.072 --> 00:21:00.672
Pan, pan, pan.
Northeastern 140.

266
00:21:00.706 --> 00:21:03.038
Vi har brandindikering
