- Forstået.

273
00:21:17.038 --> 00:21:18.572
Forstået, KZAK.
Northeastern 140.

274
00:21:18.606 --> 00:21:19.639
Styrer mod Guam

275
00:21:19.672 --> 00:21:22.005
