402
00:30:29.272 --> 00:30:30.740
300 fod.

403
00:30:30.773 --> 00:30:32.639
- Farten er stadig 170.
- Ben...

404
00:30:32.672 --> 00:30:33.772
Skub sædet helt tilbage.

405
00:30:33.806 --> 00:30:35.172
Stram selen.

406
00:30:35.205 --> 00:30:36.506
Hold vingen oppe, Rich.

407
00:30:37.339 --> 00:30:39.105
Jeg giver dig 10 grader venstre.

408
00:30:39.506 --> 00:30:40.906
Næsen op.

409
00:30:40.939 --> 00:30:42.272
Næsen op. 100 fod.

410
00:30:46.806 --> 00:30:48.707
Kom så, gamle pige.

411
00:31:10.973 --> 00:31:13.172
Ben, skub sædet helt tilbage.

412
00:31:16.105 --> 00:31:17.305
